2 months played out."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the Airbnb RevPAR in Surfside Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Each night a Surfside Beach listing was open to book earned $174 on average over the past year, booked or not. That figure, revenue per available night (RevPAR), folds price and occupancy into one number; the top 10% of listings made $389 or more."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far in advance do guests book Airbnbs in Surfside Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Surfside Beach stays were booked 73 days (about two and a half months) before arrival on average over the past year, so a listing that opens its calendar late misses many bookings."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long do guests stay at Airbnbs in Surfside Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The average Surfside Beach Airbnb stay lasted 5.2 nights over the past year. A listing took 17 reservations over the year on average."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How are Airbnbs in Surfside Beach rated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guests rate Surfside Beach Airbnbs 4.82 out of 5 on average. Guests score location highest and cleanliness lowest."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the best neighborhoods for Airbnb in Surfside Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ocean Boulevard, Dogwood Drive and Garden City draw the most short-term rental interest in Surfside Beach. The neighborhood guide explains what brings guests to each."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many Airbnbs are there in Surfside Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AirROI counted 551 active Airbnb listings in Surfside Beach as of September 2026. The closest tracked market is Garden City Beach, 4 km away."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much are Airbnb cleaning fees in Surfside Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In Surfside Beach, more than nine in ten listings add a cleaning fee. The median fee is $265, and some hi