+        <p id="isPasted"><strong>It&apos;s BBQ TIME!!!&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>The Town of Surfside Beach invites you to bring your family and friends for two fun days! There will be a &nbsp;BBQ competition, food, shopping, live music, activities for the kiddos, and FUN for the entire family!</p><p id="isPasted"><strong>Friday, March 6th &ndash;&nbsp;</strong><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/356/Anything-But-BBQ-Feast" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><strong>Anything but BBQ</strong></a><strong>! FREE ADMISSION</strong><br>From 4 pm to 7 pm, our BBQ Competitors will cook anything but BBQ in the Yaupon Parking Lot. Bring the family, purchase good food for dinner, and enjoy the evening!&nbsp;<br><strong>Saturday, March 7th &ndash; BBQ Festival! FREE ADMISSION</strong><br>From 10 am to 4 pm, there will be a BBQ competition, food, shopping, live music by <a href="https://noreastahmb.com/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Nor&apos;Eastah</a> MB and <a href="https://www.toomuchsylvia.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Too Much Sylvia</a>, activities for the kiddos, and FUN for the entire family!</p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>VENDORS:</strong> To sign up to be a <strong>BBQ Competitor</strong>, click the link below or&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-BBQ-Festival-Competition-Applicatio-162" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">click here<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span></a></span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;"> Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-BBQ-Festival-Competition-Applicatio-162" data-pasted="true">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-BBQ-Festival-Competition-Applicatio-162</a></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">To sign up to be an <strong>Arts &amp; Crafts Vendor</strong>, click the link below or&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Arts-Crafts-Vendor-Application-BBQ--163" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">click here<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span></a></span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;"> Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Arts-Crafts-Vendor-Application-BBQ--163" data-pasted="true">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-Arts-Crafts-Vendor-Application-BBQ--163</a></span><br>To sign up to be a <strong>NON-BBQ Food Vendor</strong>, click the link below, or <a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-FOOD-VENDOR-Application-BBQ-Festiva-164" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">click here<span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span></a><br><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-FOOD-VENDOR-Application-BBQ-Festiva-164" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"></a><a data-fr-linked="true" href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-FOOD-VENDOR-Application-BBQ-Festiva-164" data-pasted="true">https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-FOOD-VENDOR-Application-BBQ-Festiva-164</a><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span><br><a href="https://www.surfsidebeach.org/FormCenter/Events-9/2026-FOOD-VENDOR-Application-BBQ-Festiva-164" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message"><span class="ae-compliance-indent" style="display:none;">&nbsp;Version OptionsAnnual BBQ Festival Headline</span></a></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>Please note</strong> that the only way to sign up for or pay for ANY town event is through our website at <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org" data-pasted="true">www.surfsidebeach.org</a> or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. Highway 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>DETAILS:</strong></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Barbecue Food Trucks</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">BBQ Competition &nbsp;- Judging around 12:30 pm at the main stage (closest to Ocean Blvd.)&nbsp;</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Arts &amp; Crafts Vendors &nbsp;</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Festival Food, Food Trucks</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Activities for children &nbsp;</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Two Stages of Live Entertainment &nbsp;</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Judges: Ed Piotrowski-WPDE, Scotty Powell-WBTW, Halley Murrow-WMBF, and Ned Tarlton-local BBQ legend</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>ENTERTAINMENT SCHEDULE:</strong></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Saturday, March 7, 2026:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><a href="https://noreastahmb.com/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Nor&apos;Eastah MB</a></span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">: &nbsp;10 am-1 pm</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Saturday, March 7, 2026:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><a href="https://www.toomuchsylvia.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-describedby="audioeye_new_window_message">Too Much Sylvia</a></span><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">: 1 pm-4 pm</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>THINGS TO KNOW:</strong></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">The pickleball and tennis courts will be closed on Saturday, March 7th, for the BBQ Festival.</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Bring a chair and enjoy the live music!</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>MERCH:&nbsp;</strong></span>Available for purchase at Surfside Beach Town Hall (210 US HWY 17 S), at the BBQ Festival (Surfside Dr. - SSB Merch Tent)<br>Sizes available: Small through 3XL &mdash; while supplies last!</p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=4735" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="BBQ Festival T shirts" style="width: 353px;"></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><strong>PARKING:</strong></span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">Parking on side streets is allowed only on the side of the road, and all parking rules must be followed. Please do not park in the middle of the road or in resident driveways.</span><br><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">For all parking information, visit <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org/parking">www.surfsidebeach.org/parking</a> or call Pivot Parking at 843-945-0747.</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;">We invite you to join us at Surfside Beach, also known as the Family Beach, for your next vacation. Our upcoming barbecue festival promises to be an enjoyable experience for you and your loved ones. Please choose from our three hotels or explore the available rental houses to find the perfect accommodation. Our wide range of dining options will tantalize your taste buds, and numerous ocean activities will ensure a fulfilling experience. For more information, please visit our website: visitsurfsidebeach.com. We look forward to welcoming you soon!</span></p><p><span style="font-size: 15.2px;"><img src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentId=4671" class="fr-fil fr-dib" alt="2026 BBQ Roads Closed Map"></span><br></p><p><br></p>
