+        <p id="isPasted">Bring your friends &amp; family to Memorial Park EVERY Sunday, May 24th through August 30th from 4:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. for our FREE Concert Series &quot;Music in Memorial Park.&quot;<br>Bring a chair, blanket, and a picnic, and enjoy the LIVE MUSIC!<br><em>Location: Next to the Surfside Beach Library</em></p><p id="isPasted"><strong>Performance Schedule:</strong><br>May 24 - Brown &amp; Brooks&nbsp;<br>May 31 - Nor&rsquo; Eastah&nbsp;<br>June 7 - If Birds Could Fly&nbsp;<br>June 14 - Salty Dog&nbsp;<br>June 21 - Fabulous Fish Heads<br>June 28 - Mark and Dora&nbsp;<br>July 5 - Dune Fox Duo&nbsp;<br>July 12 - We Saw A Bear&nbsp;<br>July 19 - McKinney &amp; Co&nbsp;<br>July 26 - Anthony Stells<br>August 2 - Sweet Sweet&nbsp;<br>August 9 - Alex Arnick&nbsp;<br>August 16 - Alan Bibey Duo&nbsp;<br>August 23 - King Tide Duo&nbsp;<br>August 30 - City Lights Trio&nbsp;</p><p>VENDORS: We are not accepting vendors for this event.<br>Please note that the only way to sign up or make payment for ANY town event is through our website <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a> or in person at Surfside Beach Town Hall, located at 210 U.S. HWY 17 South. Surfside Beach, SC 29575. If you have any questions, please call 843-913-6111 ext. 390. We will never ask you to make payments via social media. Be aware of scammers.</p><p>For more information, visit <a data-fr-linked="true" href="//www.surfsidebeach.org">www.surfsidebeach.org</a>, our Facebook page: Town of Surfside Beach, or call 843-913-6111 ext. 390</p>
